{"run_id": "20260802T233351-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-078d5a16", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many event regions do the channels of analysis 2308.02285 contain?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2308.02285 contains 7 event regions across its channels:\n\n- Baseline W+jet reconstructed-level selection, electron channel\n- Baseline W+jet reconstructed-level selection, muon channel\n- Particle-level fiducial phase space for W+c cross section\n- Parton-level fiducial phase space for W+c cross section\n- SL (semileptonic) charm-tag selection region\n- SL W→μν additional Z+jets suppression selection\n- SV (secondary vertex) charm-tag selection region\n\nThese regions are used in the different channels of the analysis.\n\nAnswered from the graph.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2308.02285"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2308.02285"], "predicate": "channel_has_region"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "seconds": 0.004}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:region:baseline-we", "hepkg:region:baseline-wmu", "hepkg:region:fiducial-particle", "hepkg:region:fiducial-parton", "hepkg:region:sl-charm-tag", "hepkg:region:sl-wmu-zveto", "hepkg:region:sv-charm-tag"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0b8391ae0b038b3773f26ac1", "hepkg:evidence:26a6e9624a733ac138510d36", "hepkg:evidence:4b7cd15e629ced336c04cfa1", "hepkg:evidence:60602de0eec9fabdadc21b71", "hepkg:evidence:7db969b1af6d22e049eb6d8a", "hepkg:evidence:87955def21b71556429a15a4", "hepkg:evidence:ccad5307d926f5809263a047", "hepkg:evidence:e9cb8ca4ba0c184902ae50eb"], "seen_values": ["2308.02285", "additional", "baseline", "channel", "channel_has_region", "charm-tag", "cross", "electron", "event_region", "fiducial", "for", "hepkg:region:baseline-we", "hepkg:region:baseline-wmu", "hepkg:region:fiducial-particle", "hepkg:region:fidu