{"run_id": "20260802T233351-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-110f5056", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many event regions do the channels of analysis 2102.01444 contain?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2102.01444 contains a total of 20 event regions across its channels. These regions include various signal, control, and validation regions for the two-body, three-body, and four-body selections. \n\nHere is a summary of the regions:\n\n- **Two-body selection:**\n  - Signal regions: SR-DF\\(^{2-body}_{[x,y)}\\), SR-SF\\(^{2-body}_{[x,y)}\\), SR\\(^{2-body}_{[x,\\infty)}\\)\n  - Control regions: CR\\(^{2-body}_{t\\bar t}\\), CR\\(_{t\\bar t Z}\\), CR\\(^{FNP}\\)\n  - Validation regions: VR\\(^{2-body}_{t\\bar t,DF}\\), VR\\(^{2-body}_{t\\bar t,SF}\\), VR\\(^{2-body}_{t\\bar t Z}\\)\n\n- **Three-body selection:**\n  - Signal regions: SR-DF\\(^{3-body}_{W}\\), SR-SF\\(^{3-body}_{W}\\), SR-DF\\(^{3-body}_{t}\\), SR-SF\\(^{3-body}_{t}\\)\n  - Control regions: CR\\(^{3-body}_{t\\bar t}\\), CR\\(^{3-body}_{VV}\\), CR\\(_{t\\bar t Z}\\), CR\\(^{FNP}\\)\n  - Validation regions: VR(1)\\(^{3-body}_{t\\bar t}\\), VR(2)\\(^{3-body}_{t\\bar t}\\), VR\\(^{3-body}_{VV}\\)\n\n- **Four-body selection:**\n  - Signal regions: SR\\(^{4-body}_{Small\\, \\Delta m}\\), SR\\(^{4-body}_{Large\\, \\Delta m}\\)\n  - Control regions: CR\\(^{4-body}_{t\\bar t}\\), CR\\(^{4-body}_{VV}\\)\n  - Validation region: VR\\(^{4-body}_{t\\bar t}\\)\n\nThis comprehensive set of regions allows for detailed analysis and validation of the different decay modes and mass differences targeted by the analysis.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2102.01444"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2102.01444"], "predicate": "result_has_channel"}, "rows": 3, "error": null, "seconds": 0.003}, {"round": 1, "tool": "describe", "args