{"run_id": "20260802T233351-hepkg", "qid": "gen-paper-154f8278", "repeat": 0, "system": "hepkg", "config_hash": "b29c4f777113", "git_sha": "6945b02-dirty", "question": "How many simulated samples does analysis 2504.13081 use?", "shape": "count", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "easy", "answer": {"text": "The analysis 2504.13081 uses the following simulated samples:\n\n1. **SM ggH prediction, MadGraph5_aMC@NLO NLO reweighted to NNLOPS** (ID: hepkg:sample:sm-ggh-mg5amcnlo-nnlops)\n2. **SM ggH prediction, POWHEG (version 2)** (ID: hepkg:sample:sm-ggh-powheg)\n3. **SM non-ggH (qqH+VH+ttH) prediction, MadGraph5_aMC@NLO NLO** (ID: hepkg:sample:sm-nonggh-mg5amcnlo)\n4. **SM prediction for ggH, qqH, VH, ttH production (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, NLO) used as signal templates in input analyses** (ID: hepkg:sample:sm-inputs-four-modes)\n5. **SMEFT parametrization samples (EFT2Obs workflow)** (ID: hepkg:sample:smeft-parametrization-eft2obs)\n\nIn total, the analysis uses 5 simulated samples.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2504.13081"], "value": null, "steps": [{"round": 1, "tool": "contents_of", "args": {"paper_ids": ["2504.13081"], "predicate": "result_uses_sample"}, "rows": 5, "error": null, "seconds": 0.002}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:sample:sm-ggh-mg5amcnlo-nnlops", "hepkg:sample:sm-ggh-powheg", "hepkg:sample:sm-inputs-four-modes", "hepkg:sample:sm-nonggh-mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:smeft-parametrization-eft2obs"], "evidence_ids": ["hepkg:evidence:0ba16ca88c4618c360936151", "hepkg:evidence:78ac178a46590919b47385f6", "hepkg:evidence:bc7e8664383d5d9b3129b383", "hepkg:evidence:f96501ad0fc9333bf637aa9a"], "seen_values": ["2", "2504.13081", "analyses", "eft2obs", "for", "ggh", "hepkg:sample:sm-ggh-mg5amcnlo-nnlops", "hepkg:sample:sm-ggh-powheg", "hepkg:sample:sm-inputs-four-modes", "hepkg:sample:sm-nonggh-mg5amcnlo", "hepkg:sample:smeft-parametrization-eft2obs", "input", "madgraph5_amc", "nlo", "nnlops", "non-ggh", "parametrization", "powheg", "prediction", "pro